# Note Directory Structure Rules

paths:
  - "notes/**/*"

---

## DIRECTORY STRUCTURE

Each topic folder must follow this structure:
```
notes/<topic>/
├── <topic>-notes.tex      # Main entry (NOT main.tex)
├── compile.sh             # Compilation script
├── progress.json           # Reading progress
├── chapters/
│   ├── chapter0.tex      # Literature overview (REQUIRED)
│   ├── chapter1.tex      # Chapter 1
│   └── ...
└── appendix/
    └── qa.tex            # Q&A records (REQUIRED)
```

### Multi-Part Books (e.g., do Carmo)
```
notes/differential-geometry/
├── differential-geometry-notes.tex
├── compile.sh
└── do-carmo-curves-surfaces/          # Part I
    ├── do-carmo-curves-surfaces-notes.tex
    └── chapters/chapter1.tex
```

## CHAPTER0 LITERATURE OVERVIEW FORMAT

```latex
\chapter*{引言：文献概述}\label{chap:introduction}
\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{引言：文献概述}
```

### Content Structure (in order)
1. **总述** - Background and motivation for learning this topic
2. **文献摘要总结** - Details of each paper
3. **补充参考资料** - Other relevant books/papers
4. **学习路径与前置基础知识** - Prerequisites
5. **最终目标** - Learning objectives

### Each Paper Format
```latex
\subsection{Paper Title}
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{作者:} Author names
    \item \textbf{链接:} \url{arxiv.org/abs/...} or DOI
    \item \textbf{年份:} 20XX
    \item \textbf{篇幅:} XX pages
    \item \textbf{核心贡献:}
        \begin{itemize}
            \item Contribution 1
            \item Contribution 2
        \end{itemize}
    \item \textbf{摘要:} Abstract content...
    \item \textbf{关键词:} Keyword1; Keyword2; Keyword3
\end{enumerate}
```

## COMPILE.SH SCRIPT

```bash
#!/bin/bash
FILE="causal-inference-notes"

for i in 1 2 3; do
    xelatex -interaction=nonstopmode "$FILE.tex" > /dev/null 2>&1
done

open -a Skim "$FILE.pdf"
```

## USER ANNOTATION COMMAND

```latex
\newcommand{\userannotation}[2]{%
  \begin{Remark}
    \textbf{#1:} #2
  \end{Remark}
}
```

Usage:
```latex
\userannotation{问题}{这是用户提问的内容}
\userannotation{思考}{这是用户的思考记录}
```

## HOMEWORK PATH

Homework files location:
`/Users/yueyh/Library/CloudStorage/GoogleDrive-easyasy@gmail.com/My Drive/homework`

## HOMEWORK FILE FORMAT (Obsidian callout)

```markdown
> [!exr] Problem X.X
> **Section X.X** — *Title*
>
> 题目内容...

> [!exr] Part 2 · (a)
> 子问题内容...

> [!solution] Solution to Part 2(a)
> 解答内容...
```

## OBSIDIAN CALLOUT → LATEX MAPPING

| Obsidian | LaTeX |
|----------|-------|
| `> [!note]` | `\begin{note}...\end{note}` |
| `> [!example]` | `\begin{Example}[名称]...\end{Example}` |
| `> [!thm]` | `\begin{Theorem}[名称]...\end{Theorem}` |
| `> [!def]` | `\begin{Definition}[名称]...\end{Definition}` |
| `> [!exr]` | `\begin{Exercise}{题号}...\end{Exercise}` |
| `> [!solution]` | `\begin{Proof}...\end{Proof}` |
| `> [!rmk]` | `\begin{Remark}...\end{Remark}` |
